<%- include('header') %>
<div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-body p-4"><h1 class="h3 fw-bold"><i class="bi bi-lightbulb text-warning"></i> 사고들 — AI 공격 접근 기록 <span class="engine-badge engine-<%= engine %>"><%= engine %></span></h1>
<p class="text-secondary mb-0"><%= approaches.intro %> 이 페이지는 <b><%= engine %></b> 엔진 관련 항목만 보여줍니다.</p></div></div>
<% for (const group of approaches.groups) { %>
<h4 class="fw-bold mt-4 mb-2"><%= group.title %></h4>
<div class="row g-3"><% for (const e of group.entries) { %>
<div class="col-lg-6"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body">
<div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start mb-1">
<h5 class="fw-bold mb-0"><%= e.title %></h5>
<div class="text-nowrap"><% for (const en of (e.engines||[])) { %><span class="engine-badge engine-<%= en %>"><%= en %></span> <% } %><% if (e.ref) { %><a class="badge text-bg-info text-decoration-none" href="/practice#v<%= e.ref %>">#<%= e.ref %></a><% } %></div></div>
<% if (e.explain) { %><div class="alert alert-light border small mb-2"><b><i class="bi bi-book"></i> 개념 설명:</b> <%= e.explain %></div><% } %>
<p class="small text-secondary mb-2"><i class="bi bi-chat-quote"></i> <b>가설:</b> <%= e.thought %></p>
<% for (const s of (e.steps||[])) { %><div class="mb-2"><code class="d-block" style="white-space:pre-wrap"><%= s.cmd %></code><div class="small text-success ps-2">↳ <%= s.result %></div></div><% } %>
<p class="mb-0 mt-2"><span class="badge text-bg-dark">결과</span> <%= e.result %></p>
</div></div></div>
<% } %></div>
<% } %>
<p class="small text-secondary mt-4">전부 로컬 검증 결과입니다. 항목 번호는 <a href="/practice">실습실</a> 카탈로그와 연결됩니다.</p>
<%- include('footer') %>
